idle-cosmic (3.2.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove the ineffective IDLE_REQUIRE_MANIFEST_SIGNATURE=1 from the pkexec
    applet-install path. No package manager reads that variable, so it never
    gated anything; the path now fails closed unless install.sh has already
    configured the fingerprint-verified repository, instead of resolving
    idle-cosmic as root from whatever repository happened to be configured.
    (Corrects the claim first made in 3.2.0-1.)

 -- IdleScreen Maintainers <maintainers@idlescreen.dev>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

